                                "sense_id": "0bd49c3e-b8ae-3dbe-9d0f-cb106ab8c290",
                                "text": "He's drawn Dwayne as a cave-man. A really derpy, mugly caveman, with a sloping forehead, a drooling mouth and Dwayne's buzz cut."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d3b09392-3b20-4402-af56-c762e6e6cdf8",
                                "sense_id": "0bd49c3e-b8ae-3dbe-9d0f-cb106ab8c290",
                                "text": "The other one is a video titled ”I’m Sucking On A Sour Patch Kid Listening To Music Getting Ready For Tonight” featuring DJ Encore’s “I See Right Through You” and the incredibly derpy faces of Bynes. Like most wrecks, it’s hard to look away."
